Error: --modality is required
Track N events of one modality, flush to /api/v2/sdk/telemetry/{modality} and report the backend's accounting. Production runs the auth handshake first; development is keyless. Exits non-zero when any POST fails.

Usage: wally telemetry emit [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
      --modality {llm,stt,tts,vlm,rag,imagegen,embeddings,vad,voice,lora,model,system} REQUIRED
                              Telemetry modality
      --event-type TEXT       Event type string (default: the modality's terminal event, e.g.
                              llm.generation.completed)
      --count POSITIVE        Number of events to emit (default 1)
      --session-id TEXT       Session id attached to every event (default: fresh UUID)
      --processing-ms FLOAT   processing_time_ms metric for every event
      --input-tokens INT      input_tokens metric (llm/vlm modalities)
      --output-tokens INT     output_tokens metric (llm/vlm modalities)
      --audio-duration-ms FLOAT
                              audio_duration_ms metric (stt modality)
